"""NexaBrowser / NexaAura Python Runner, manual-email edition.

Flow: open URL -> Get Started -> name -> DOB -> gender ->
Sign up with email address -> wait for user to paste email -> Next ->
password from NexaBrowser Password extension -> Next -> Save -> I agree -> stop.

Only use on sites/accounts where you are authorized to perform this workflow.
Controls the current NexaBrowser WebView2 tab with its nexa_browser SDK.
No extra browser window, CAPTCHA handling, or verification-code automation.

The configuration popup appears every run with an editable URL and random action
wait range (default 200-500 ms). Email is never entered by the script, printed,
or saved. No Number extension entries are read, changed, or deleted.
"""

